  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/h5PZk4XS090?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">由《<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/maps/2808484-mario-kart-in-minecraft-by-flamingosaurus-and\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 瑪利歐賽車</a>》創作者帶來另一款競速戰鬥地圖！這次完全不含版權素材，並已正式收錄至 Java 版 Minecraft Realms 中。《Sprint Racer》並非單純複製貼上，而是經過全面重寫、平衡調整與打磨，閃耀如鏡！</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">特色</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">支援任意人數（1 至無限）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">競速與戰鬥模式</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">50 條賽道、18 個戰鬥競技場</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">20 種獨特道具</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">自訂賽道編輯器 <em>（*非 Realms 獨佔功能）</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">智慧型 AI 對手</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">創用 CC 配樂（感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fzetasphere\" rel=\"nofollow\">ZetaSphere</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fargofox\" rel=\"nofollow\">Argofox</a> 唱片提供）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">豐富的選項與額外功能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">隱藏密技</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">公開伺服器「管理員模式」</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/resource_media/screenshot/15067603_lrg.png\" alt=\"遊戲大廳\" width=\"1280\" height=\"667\"></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">支援語言</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">英文</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">法文（fr_fr、fr_ca）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">日文（ja_jp）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">簡體中文（zh_cn）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">繁體中文（zh_tw）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">韓文（ko）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">LOLCAT（lol_us）</span></li>\n</ul><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">相容性</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#5f5;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">相容於：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Minecraft: Java Edition 1.16 - 1.21（請確認使用正確的地圖版本！）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">BungeeCord</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Fabric（不保證遊戲穩定性，建議以原生版本遊玩）</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">不相容於：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Multiverse</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">過多伺服器插件（極可能出現問題）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Java Edition 以外的 Minecraft 版本</span></li>\n</ul><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">自《Mario Kart MC》以來的變更</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">效能與穩定度大幅提升。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">單人模式因加入AI而更加完善。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">新增許多獨家賽道！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">道具與道具系統全面翻新，大幅改善遊戲體驗。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">大廳設計精簡，但自訂選項比以往更多。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">新增多種遊戲模式，如「末位淘汰賽」。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">賽道編輯器更加使用者友善。</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">《Sprint Racer》也於 StickyPiston 試玩版中提供：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftrial.stickypiston.co%252fmap%252fsprintracer\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#000\"><img src=\"https://stickypiston.co/wp-content/uploads/sprintracer_banner.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"755\" height=\"144\"></span></a></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">製作團隊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>遊戲設計</strong> -- Flamingosaurus、AriaZeroQueen<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>程式設計</strong> -- Flamingosaurus</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>遊戲大廳</strong> -- MCFilms、Jayjo</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>賽道設計</strong> -- AriaZeroQueen、Flamingosaurus、ReflectedMantis、RedstoneBattery、alyssonjac6、MichaelMana、Marioman237、Darkbrine、Endermity、MCFilms、Jayjo、StraightFlex、Mezimo、Cqvid_69、SenpaiiPepe</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>自訂模型</strong> -- Frenderman、Flamingosaurus</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>雜項建築協助</strong> -- RedstoneBattery、alyssonjac6、Darkbrine</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.flamingosaurus.com%252fgames%252fsprint-racer%252fresources\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>額外軟體與插件</strong></a> -- tari_cat</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>測試/回饋</strong> -- RedstoneBattery、ashjade210、CosmicMary、ReflectedMantis、Darkbrine、MCFilms、Szpecter、KittyCatElite、Bed_Gsd、MarioSpore</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>宣傳素材</strong> -- FortressFrog、Mezimo、Frenderman、JohnGlacious</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">想要更多賽道嗎？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">試試 ReflectedMantis 的 <strong><em>瑪利歐賽車賽道包！</em>&nbsp;</strong>這是《Sprint Racer》的最新版本，額外加裝 20 條自訂賽道。</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.flamingosaurus.com%252fgames%252fsprint-racer%252fcustom-tracks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#5f5\">你可以在此找到這個賽道包（以及其他自訂賽道）的連結。</span></a></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/b5s8VlB8Kaw\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
